@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / create account
CreateAccount : do / validate registration
CreateAccount : exit / Login / Invalid Registration

state "Invalid Registration" as InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration : entry / invalid registration
InvalidRegistration : do / cannot register
InvalidRegistration : exit / Abnormal termination

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / login
Login : do / login using valid username and password
Login : exit / CheckWeather / Logout

state "Check Weather" as CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry / check weather
CheckWeather : do / get current location or new location
CheckWeather : exit / InvalidLocation / SelectWeatherInfo

state "Invalid Location" as InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation : entry / invalid location
InvalidLocation : do / cannot proceed
InvalidLocation : exit / Abnormal termination

state "Select Weather Info" as SelectWeatherInfo
SelectWeatherInfo : entry / select weather info
SelectWeatherInfo : do / get selected weather info
SelectWeatherInfo : exit / ViewAdditionalDetails / Logout

state "View Additional Details" as ViewAdditionalDetails
ViewAdditionalDetails : entry / view additional details
ViewAdditionalDetails : do / get additional weather details
ViewAdditionalDetails : exit / EndSession

state "End Session" as EndSession
EndSession : entry / end session
EndSession : do / log out
EndSession : exit / [*]

Login --> CheckWeather
CheckWeather --> InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation --> AbnormalTermination
CheckWeather --> SelectWeatherInfo
SelectWeatherInfo --> ViewAdditionalDetails
ViewAdditionalDetails --> EndSession

@enduml
